; NextDAAD keystroke lab: the typeahead regression fixture. Text only,
; window 0 full screen, prompt ">" (flag 42 = 34). LONG prints and pauses so
; a player can type the next command early (LONG pauses 2.5 s). The screen is never cleared
; after a response; flag 200 guards the one-time init.

/CTL
_
/VOC
LONG   50  verb
SHORT  51  verb
ANYK   52  verb
GETK   53  verb
MOREX  54  verb
LOOK   4   verb
/STX
/0  "It's too dark to see anything."
/1  "I can also see:"
/2  "What now?"
/3  "What next?"
/4  "What should I do now?"
/5  "What should I do next?"
/6  "I didn't understand."
/7  "I can't go in that direction."
/8  "I can't do that."
/9  "I have with me:"
/10 "I am wearing:"
/11 " "
/12 "Are you sure?"
/13 "Another go?"
/14 " "
/15 "OK."
/16 "Press any key."
/17 " "
/18 " "
/19 " "
/20 " "
/21 " "
/22 " "
/23 "I'm not wearing one of those."
/24 "I can't. My hands are full."
/25 "I already have the _."
/26 "There isn't one of those here."
/27 "I can't carry any more things."
/28 "I don't have one of those."
/29 "I'm already wearing the _."
/30 "Y"
/31 "N"
/32 "More..."
/33 ">"
/34 " "
/35 " "
/36 "I now have the _."
/37 "I'm now wearing the _."
/38 "I've removed the _."
/39 "I've dropped the _."
/40 "I can't wear the _."
/41 "I can't remove the _."
/42 "I can't remove the _. My hands are full."
/43 "The _ weighs too much for me."
/44 "The _ is in the"
/45 "The _ isn't in the"
/46 ", "
/47 " and "
/48 ".#n"
/49 "I don't have the _."
/50 "I'm not wearing the _."
/51 "."
/52 "There isn't one of those in the"
/53 "Nothing."
/54 " "
/55 " "
/56 " "
/57 "I/O Error"
/58 " "
/59 "File name error."
/60 "Type in name of file."
/MTX
/0 "You are in the keystroke lab.#n"
/1 "long "
/2 "short#n"
/3 "before anykey#n"
/4 "after anykey#n"
/5 "press a key#n"
/6 "more "
/OTX
/0 "a thing"
/LTX
/0 "Keystroke lab."
/CON
/0
/OBJ
/0    0   1   _ _  _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _   _ _
/PRO 0
> _ _        ZERO 200
             LET 42 34
             WINDOW 0
             CLS
             MESSAGE 0
             LET 200 1
> _ _        PARSE 0
             REDO
> _ _        PROCESS 1
             REDO
/PRO 1
> LONG  _    LET 100 0
             PROCESS 2
             PAUSE 250
             DONE
> SHORT _    MESSAGE 2
             DONE
> ANYK  _    MESSAGE 3
             ANYKEY
             MESSAGE 4
             DONE
> GETK  _    MESSAGE 5
             PAUSE 0
             PRINT 60
             NEWLINE
             DONE
> MOREX _    LET 100 0
             PROCESS 3
             DONE
> LOOK  _    MESSAGE 0
             DONE
/PRO 2
> _ _        LT 100 20
             PLUS 100 1
             MES 1
             PRINT 100
             NEWLINE
             REDO
> _ _        DONE
/PRO 3
> _ _        LT 100 40
             PLUS 100 1
             MES 6
             PRINT 100
             NEWLINE
             REDO
> _ _        DONE
/END
